LATENCY: tenant5 pings 10.10.0.1 every 0.2 s during each run and reference run; slo_ok_v2_rtt = 1 iff p99 <= max(2 x reference p99, 2 ms) AND loss <= 1%; slo_ok_worst_with_rtt = slo_ok_worst x slo_ok_v2_rtt; no controller sees the RTT
